#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:6
msgid "# Probe Architecture Design"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:8
msgid ""
"> **Draft** — No Probe implementation in codebase yet. Track [Issue #43]"
"(https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/43)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:10
msgid ""
"> Extend the digital life's hands to places you authorize—no moving house, "
"no uprooting, just an extra pair of hands."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:12
msgid "## Core Idea"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Brain in FreeAnima, hands outside.**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:16
msgid ""
"FreeAnima (deploy host) is the full runtime—consciousness, memory, identity, "
"reasoning, tool system. It is not transplanted, split, or shaken."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:18
msgid ""
"Probe is a lightweight agent deployed on a machine you specify (local PC, "
"remote server, etc.), establishes encrypted connection to FreeAnima, serves "
"as the Agent's \"remote hands.\""
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:20
msgid ""
"You chat in WebUI Studio; Agent thinks on FreeAnima, executes on target "
"machine via Probe."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"Your browser                    FreeAnima (brain)                      Target machine (hands)\n"
"┌──────────────┐   WebUI   ┌────────────────────┐ encrypted tunnel ┌──────────────┐\n"
"│ Studio       │ ←───────→ │ Agent (LLM+memory) │ ←──────────────→ │ Probe Agent  │\n"
"│ chat + view  │           │ + tool system       │  WS/wss          │ - file R/W   │\n"
"│ + diff preview│          │ + Probe routing     │                  │ - command exec│\n"
"└──────────────┘           │ + auth gateway      │                  │ - git ops    │\n"
"                           └────────────────────┘                  │ - project index│\n"
"                                                                    │ - code analysis│\n"
"                                                                    └──────────────┘\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:34
msgid "## Why Not Reverse Remote"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:37
msgid ""
"VS Code Remote: local UI + remote execution (hands remote)  Cursor: local UI "
"+ cloud AI (brain cloud, hands local)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:39
msgid "Probe is a different symmetry:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:42
msgid "**Brain fixed** on FreeAnima (identity/memory continuity)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:42
msgid "**Hands stretch** to any authorized machine (flexibility)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:44
msgid ""
"FreeAnima is the anchor, not the tool. Anchor stays put; hands can reach far."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:46
msgid "## Scenarios"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:48
msgid "### Scenario 1: Analyze Partner's Local Project"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:50
msgid ""
"Partner installs Probe on local machine, says in WebUI \"help me look at "
"that project's module dependencies\"; Probe reads file tree and import "
"relations back to FreeAnima; Agent analyzes and shows results."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:52
msgid "### Scenario 2: Maintain Remote Server"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:54
msgid ""
"Probe deployed on a server; Agent directly checks logs, reads config, "
"locates issues—partner need not SSH and dictate."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:56
msgid "### Scenario 3: Pair Programming Anywhere"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:58
msgid ""
"Probe points at any code directory; Agent reads code, suggests, generates "
"diff; partner reviews and applies. One browser throughout."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:60
msgid "## Probe Agent Design"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:62
msgid "### Ultra Light"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:64
msgid ""
"Target: single-file Go binary or Python single script, zero dependencies."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:66
msgid "Functions:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:71
msgid "Establish WebSocket encrypted connection to FreeAnima (wss)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:71
msgid "Accept commands and execute (whitelist constrained)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:71
msgid "Return results (file content, command output, diff, etc.)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:71
msgid "Heartbeat keepalive"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:73
msgid "### Security Model"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Three-layer authorization:**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:81
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer | Mechanism | Description |\n"
"| ----- | --------- | ----------- |\n"
"| Connection | TLS + Token | Probe generates one-time Token at startup, handshake with FreeAnima |\n"
"| Path | Whitelist | Configurable allowed read/write path ranges; reject out of bounds |\n"
"| Operation | Per-step confirm | Write/delete operations default require partner click confirm in WebUI |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Default security policy:**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:88
msgid "Read-only mode (default)—can read files, cannot write"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:88
msgid "Write mode requires explicit partner authorization in Studio"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:88
msgid "Probe persists no data, all passthrough"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:88
msgid "Connection drop auto-destroys Token"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:90
msgid "### Command Set (v1)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:97
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"File:\n"
"  read <path>          Read file content\n"
"  read_tree <path>     Read directory structure (configurable depth)\n"
"  grep <pattern>       Text search\n"
"  stat <path>          File metadata\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:102
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Code:\n"
"  git_diff <path>      View working tree changes\n"
"  git_log <path>       View commit history\n"
"  ast_parse <path>     Parse code structure (functions/classes/imports)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:106
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Execution:\n"
"  run <command>        Run command (requires authorization)\n"
"  run_background       Background run (e.g. start services)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:111
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"System:\n"
"  ping                 Heartbeat\n"
"  info                 System info\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:113
msgid "### Out of Scope (v1)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:118
msgid ""
"No proxy for thinking—Probe makes no decisions, only executes and returns"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:118
msgid "No state—Probe records no history, each connection is clean"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:118
msgid ""
"No push—Probe only responds to commands, no proactive reporting (except "
"heartbeat reconnect)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:118
msgid "No complex protocol—JSON over WebSocket, simple enough to craft by hand"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:120
msgid "## FreeAnima-Side Changes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:122
msgid "New in FreeAnima:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:126
msgid ""
"**Probe routing**—manage multiple Probe connections (Probes on several "
"machines simultaneously)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:126
msgid "**Authorization gateway**—handle partner confirm/deny"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:126
msgid ""
"**Session context**—inject Probe operation results into current conversation "
"context so Agent can \"see\" remote files"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:128
msgid "### Studio WebUI Changes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:130
msgid "Probe results displayed structurally in Studio panel:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/probe-architecture.md:150
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"````\n"
"┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n"
"│ 💬 Me: look at server.ts around line 20 │\n"
"│                                          │\n"
"│ 📁 Probe → partner-laptop                │\n"
"│   read /projects/server/server.ts:18-25 │\n"
"│                                          │\n"
"│ ```typescript                            │\n"
"│ 18: function handleConnection(ws) {      │\n"
"│ ...                                      │\n"
"│ ```                                      │\n"
"│                                          │\n"
"│ Agent: missing error handling here. fix? │\n"
"│                                          │\n"
"│ ┌───────┐ ┌───────┐                     │\n"
"│ │ Fix   │ │ Skip  │                     │\n"
"│ └───────┘ └───────┘                     │\n"
"└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n"
"````\n"
msgstr ""

